sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Get recipe ideas
    %% Stories: 14, 30, 31, 45
    %% Description: An employee adds recipes. A customer browses recipe ideas, gets recipes for liked products and sees the products a recipe uses.
    actor EM as Employee
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant RE as Recipe
    participant PR as Product
    participant CU as Customer
    participant WL as Wishlist

    %% covers 45
    EM->>RE: add new recipe
    RE->>PR: products used
    %% covers 30
    CP->>RE: browse recipe ideas
    %% covers 14
    CP->>CU: get recipes for liked products
    CU->>WL: liked products
    WL->>PR: products
    PR->>RE: matching recipes
    %% covers 31
    CP->>RE: see products used in a recipe
